WEBVTT

00:00:14.055 --> 00:00:16.975
<i>Thank goodness Lucien's back</i>
<i>to himself again.</i>

00:00:17.058 --> 00:00:19.144
<i>He smells like a summer day.</i>

00:00:19.227 --> 00:00:20.937
<i>Just like he usually does.</i>

00:00:23.773 --> 00:00:26.401
That was definitely Dark Schneider.

00:00:27.861 --> 00:00:29.279
I'm glad you're okay.

00:00:30.905 --> 00:00:33.241
It looks like Kevidubu was defeated.

00:00:34.951 --> 00:00:38.288
Master Gara,
what was that powerful aura?

00:00:38.371 --> 00:00:41.082
Oh, that was the Venom spell.

00:00:41.166 --> 00:00:43.710
So it appears that it's true.

00:00:43.793 --> 00:00:46.046
Dark Schneider came back to life.

00:00:47.505 --> 00:00:51.176
<i>Fifteen years ago,</i>
<i>he lead four of us to conquer the world.</i>

00:00:51.259 --> 00:00:54.763
<i>The war between the four kingdoms</i>
<i>went on for four years.</i>

00:00:54.846 --> 00:00:57.557
<i>There's no one stronger</i>
<i>than Dark Schneider.</i>

00:00:59.559 --> 00:01:02.395
So then
why isn't Dark Schneider helping us?

00:01:03.313 --> 00:01:04.606
From what I can tell,

00:01:05.148 --> 00:01:07.650
it seems like he's trying
to defend the kingdom.

00:01:09.778 --> 00:01:10.695
Right.

00:01:10.779 --> 00:01:14.157
It's our job to find out
exactly why he's defending them.

00:01:14.240 --> 00:01:17.786
But what happens if Dark Schneider
chooses to fight against us

00:01:17.869 --> 00:01:19.412
instead of joining us?

00:01:19.496 --> 00:01:23.792
He'll be the greatest enemy
we've ever faced. I guarantee it.

00:01:23.875 --> 00:01:25.293
And I tell you here and now,

00:01:25.376 --> 00:01:27.545
if anyone tries to get in our way,

00:01:27.629 --> 00:01:31.716
I don't care who you are,
my father, my brother, my friend,

00:01:32.300 --> 00:01:37.138
then I, the one and only ninja master,
Gara, along with my dark ninja army

00:01:37.222 --> 00:01:40.141
will be here and ready to take your life.

00:01:40.225 --> 00:01:41.893
Just who do you think you are?

00:01:41.976 --> 00:01:43.603
Strangers aren't allowed here.

00:01:45.063 --> 00:01:46.064
Scatter!

00:01:46.564 --> 00:01:48.691
Hold it! Stay where you are, cowards!

00:01:48.775 --> 00:01:50.068
You won't escape!

00:01:50.151 --> 00:01:52.028
Murasame Blade! Majinken!

00:02:01.204 --> 00:02:02.705
Too easy.

00:03:37.550 --> 00:03:39.594
The dark clouds are still spreading.

00:03:39.677 --> 00:03:42.263
They have been blocking out
the sunlight for days.

00:03:42.347 --> 00:03:43.723
This isn't good.

00:03:44.933 --> 00:03:48.770
Uh, Master Geo, you said
they're trying to resurrect the demon god.

00:03:48.853 --> 00:03:50.855
Are you certain about that?

00:03:50.939 --> 00:03:55.026
When our society was at it's peak
several centuries ago,

00:03:55.109 --> 00:03:59.489
the God of Destruction, Anthrasax,
almost completely wiped out humanity.

00:03:59.572 --> 00:04:03.826
Today,
Anthrasax is sealed away by four seals.

00:04:03.910 --> 00:04:06.037
If the first seal is broken,

00:04:06.120 --> 00:04:11.542
the demon god will awaken from stasis
and create dark clouds on the horizon.

00:04:11.626 --> 00:04:14.045
That's what's written
in the ancient texts.

00:04:14.671 --> 00:04:17.674
The seals are guarded
by the four royal families,

00:04:17.757 --> 00:04:19.926
all of whom have ancient blood.

00:04:20.009 --> 00:04:24.597
The first seal has been guarded
by the Judas family for generations.

00:04:24.681 --> 00:04:27.308
Clearly the first seal has been broken,

00:04:27.392 --> 00:04:29.519
meaning the human race
could face annihilation.

00:04:29.602 --> 00:04:32.563
How can this be happening?

00:04:32.647 --> 00:04:36.150
I can't believe someone would try
to bring the demon god back to life!

00:04:36.234 --> 00:04:38.903
Only Kall-Su is evil enough to do this!

00:04:39.487 --> 00:04:42.282
I'm sure
the other three must be aiding him.

00:04:42.782 --> 00:04:43.992
<i>Kall-Su?</i>

00:04:44.075 --> 00:04:47.745
Um, Father?
What kind of person is Kall-Su?

00:04:49.080 --> 00:04:53.418
He's an evil sorcerer
and one of Dark Schneider's close friends.

00:04:53.501 --> 00:04:56.087
He was one of his four senior disciples.

00:04:56.170 --> 00:04:57.797
Fifteen years ago,

00:04:57.880 --> 00:05:00.717
he fought alongside Dark Schneider
in the war.

00:05:00.800 --> 00:05:03.303
And his magic is just as powerful too.

00:05:03.386 --> 00:05:06.723
Some say it's even more powerful.

00:05:07.849 --> 00:05:10.560
Abigail! Where's Abigail?

00:05:10.643 --> 00:05:12.729
He's inside the dungeon temple.

00:05:14.355 --> 00:05:15.481
He's inside?

00:05:15.565 --> 00:05:17.817
Yes, but he said no one must enter.

00:05:25.950 --> 00:05:28.703
So tell me, how is our god?

00:05:30.538 --> 00:05:33.082
Kall-Su, do you hear it?

00:05:33.166 --> 00:05:34.792
The heartbeat is strong.

00:05:35.501 --> 00:05:37.253
Our wonderful God of Destruction

00:05:37.337 --> 00:05:40.465
is the most powerful
among the demon gods of yore.

00:05:40.548 --> 00:05:43.968
Created by the almighty ancient magic
of the old world.

00:05:44.552 --> 00:05:48.306
The heartbeat is a sign
that Anthrasax's return is approaching.

00:05:48.389 --> 00:05:52.518
Judas Castle had the first seal here
where this underground temple is located.

00:05:53.227 --> 00:05:55.271
Tomorrow, we will attack Meta-llicana.

00:05:55.355 --> 00:05:57.273
They are guarding the second seal.

00:05:58.691 --> 00:06:01.027
If we conquer
the two remaining kingdoms,

00:06:01.110 --> 00:06:03.154
then we'll have broken
all four of the seals.

00:06:03.237 --> 00:06:05.406
Our demon god will fully awaken.

00:06:08.117 --> 00:06:12.914
I can't wait to see Anthrasax's
tremendous power awaken once again.

00:06:13.498 --> 00:06:16.751
A great wave of destruction
will be sent across the land.

00:06:16.834 --> 00:06:17.668
Yes.

00:06:21.089 --> 00:06:22.048
What did you say?

00:06:22.632 --> 00:06:25.009
You want Lucien
to be Dark Schneider again?

00:06:25.093 --> 00:06:29.555
Uh, that sorcerer and Hydra were probably
just troops they sent ahead as a warning.

00:06:29.639 --> 00:06:31.015
You must understand,

00:06:31.099 --> 00:06:34.685
the army that conquered Judas Castle
will surely arrive in our kindgom soon,

00:06:34.769 --> 00:06:36.270
and we don't stand a chance.

00:06:36.354 --> 00:06:37.855
The only one capable of beating them--

00:06:37.939 --> 00:06:39.440
Wha…? No! Stop!

00:06:39.524 --> 00:06:41.275
Don't even think about it. No way!

00:06:41.359 --> 00:06:43.820
We just had that big incident
with him the other day.

00:06:43.903 --> 00:06:46.239
B-but this is the only way
we could possibly--

00:06:46.322 --> 00:06:49.700
No! That's not fair to Lucien at all!

00:06:49.784 --> 00:06:51.494
He can't just transform when you want.

00:06:51.577 --> 00:06:53.162
We're not your tools.

00:06:53.246 --> 00:06:55.873
I won't let you turn him
into Dark Schneider again.

00:06:56.958 --> 00:07:00.420
We've pushed too hard,
and now she's put her guard up.

00:07:00.503 --> 00:07:03.798
Hmm. However, she's correct
that bringing him back is risky.

00:07:03.881 --> 00:07:07.093
Yoko, what's the matter?
Is everything okay?

00:07:07.593 --> 00:07:10.471
Don't cry. It can't be that bad, right?

00:07:14.475 --> 00:07:15.977
<i>What's wrong with them?</i>

00:07:16.060 --> 00:07:18.354
<i>They're all so selfish!</i>

00:07:18.438 --> 00:07:21.441
<i>Don't they realize</i>
<i>how embarrassing all of this is for me?</i>

00:07:22.150 --> 00:07:25.528
<i>My first kiss…</i>
<i>And now I have to do it again?</i>

00:07:25.611 --> 00:07:28.781
<i>A maiden's kiss isn't some toy</i>
<i>for them to play with.</i>

00:07:28.865 --> 00:07:30.533
Hey, Yoko?

00:07:31.200 --> 00:07:32.034
Hmm?

00:07:32.118 --> 00:07:35.121
What are you doing? Can we play now?

00:07:35.204 --> 00:07:36.164
Hey, listen.

00:07:36.247 --> 00:07:38.833
I have a lot on my mind right now, okay?

00:07:38.916 --> 00:07:40.209
Can you just be quiet?

00:07:40.293 --> 00:07:42.795
No, 'cause it's time to play.

00:07:44.589 --> 00:07:47.091
Come on! Quit playing around!

00:07:47.175 --> 00:07:48.551
You're just like a puppy.

00:07:48.634 --> 00:07:50.344
Go sit over there for now.

00:07:52.722 --> 00:07:54.765
Maybe I'll just go do the laundry.

00:07:59.729 --> 00:08:01.564
You know, I really like doing the wash.

00:08:01.647 --> 00:08:03.441
Good for you! Just go!

00:08:06.277 --> 00:08:07.904
He's just so clueless.

00:08:07.987 --> 00:08:09.864
CONGRATULATIONS
ON YOUR FIRST DAY OF SCHOOL

00:08:09.947 --> 00:08:11.157
<i>Oh, Lucien.</i>

00:08:11.240 --> 00:08:13.826
<i>You're so lucky</i>
<i>you've got nothing to worry about.</i>

00:08:13.910 --> 00:08:16.370
Well, that would be nice. I'm jealous.

00:08:16.454 --> 00:08:18.122
Hey, Lucien!

00:08:19.123 --> 00:08:21.959
You're so stupid!
Dumb, little laundry boy.

00:08:22.043 --> 00:08:24.504
Hey, you jerks! Stop that!

00:08:24.587 --> 00:08:26.464
Oh, here comes Yoko.

00:08:26.547 --> 00:08:28.132
Wow. She's rowdy today.

00:08:28.716 --> 00:08:30.718
Run away!

00:08:30.801 --> 00:08:32.428
Stay away from him!

00:08:32.512 --> 00:08:33.971
You know, Lucien's actually--

00:08:34.055 --> 00:08:36.432
Hey! Are you listening to me?

00:08:38.476 --> 00:08:40.603
Well, I'm gonna go start the laundry.

00:08:41.687 --> 00:08:44.607
Sometimes it's so disappointing
to see you like this.

00:08:44.690 --> 00:08:47.151
I mean, you're just so different
when you're Dark Schneider.

00:08:48.236 --> 00:08:49.278
Hmm?

00:08:51.531 --> 00:08:53.449
Whoever Lucien loves,

00:08:54.033 --> 00:08:55.535
<i>I love them as well.</i>

00:08:59.121 --> 00:09:02.458
<i>I… </i>

00:09:02.542 --> 00:09:04.835
<i>I…</i>

00:09:10.258 --> 00:09:12.343
<i>Which is the better Lucien?</i>

00:09:13.010 --> 00:09:15.096
<i>I am Lucien. I swear it.</i>

00:09:15.179 --> 00:09:16.305
<i>You're not him.</i>

00:09:18.349 --> 00:09:20.476
Maybe I was too hard on him before.

00:09:25.439 --> 00:09:26.899
You're like a little chick.

00:09:28.526 --> 00:09:34.073
<i>I can't believe you and Dark Schneider</i>
<i>are supposedly the same person.</i>

00:09:34.699 --> 00:09:38.077
<i>If Dark Schneider</i>
<i>really is Lucien's true form,</i>

00:09:38.160 --> 00:09:41.706
<i>then who is this version of Lucien</i>
<i>I've grown up with all these years?</i>

00:09:47.211 --> 00:09:49.922
I guess I don't know what to think.

00:09:53.009 --> 00:09:55.928
Oh, Lucien. Just who are you?

00:09:59.932 --> 00:10:01.475
Laundry… mine…

00:10:03.603 --> 00:10:06.230
<i>I guess Lucien is Lucien.</i>

00:10:08.190 --> 00:10:11.777
<i>I won't let him turn into</i>
<i>Dark Schneider anymore.</i>

00:10:16.782 --> 00:10:20.286
<i>Even though we're about to go to war.</i>

00:10:25.082 --> 00:10:28.628
Hurry, men!
An emergency summons has been issued.

00:10:29.211 --> 00:10:34.133
<i>When we discovered Kall-Su's</i>
<i>evil plot to resurrect the demon god,</i>

00:10:34.216 --> 00:10:35.885
<i>our castle grew restless.</i>

00:10:36.886 --> 00:10:38.220
The time has come.

00:10:38.304 --> 00:10:40.765
We'll show the world we fight
with honor and strength.

00:10:41.599 --> 00:10:43.934
<i>Meta-llicana</i>
<i>is in the midst of a crisis</i>

00:10:44.018 --> 00:10:45.519
<i>we've never experienced before.</i>

00:10:45.603 --> 00:10:47.813
<i>And it's not only Meta-llicana,</i>

00:10:47.897 --> 00:10:51.150
<i>the entire human race will be in danger</i>
<i>if they resurrect Anthrasax.</i>

00:10:51.233 --> 00:10:54.320
<i>This is something</i>
<i>that will affect all of the kingdoms.</i>

00:10:54.945 --> 00:10:57.657
<i>And yet I'm so shaken</i>
<i>by something so small.</i>

00:10:59.283 --> 00:11:00.117
I…

00:11:01.077 --> 00:11:04.205
I cannot believe
I saw that man naked twice.

00:11:04.872 --> 00:11:07.833
He is never clothed
when he appears before us.

00:11:09.543 --> 00:11:12.880
He's arrogant, wild, free.

00:11:13.381 --> 00:11:17.301
He's Tia Noto Yoko's personal sorcerer.

00:11:18.344 --> 00:11:20.012
He's just for her.

00:11:21.931 --> 00:11:23.224
Did you hear about it?

00:11:23.724 --> 00:11:27.103
There's a huge army of demi-humans
right at the border of our kingdom.

00:11:27.186 --> 00:11:30.856
They've got orcs, goblins,
and even creepy lizard-men from the bogs.

00:11:30.940 --> 00:11:35.152
I've also heard they've got some gigantic
monsters like those Hydra from today.

00:11:35.236 --> 00:11:37.947
Do you think
our forces can win on their own?

00:11:38.030 --> 00:11:40.324
If not, what will happen to our kingdom?

00:11:40.408 --> 00:11:42.660
Your kingdom will fall.

00:11:43.244 --> 00:11:45.996
Unless,
of course, you surrender to us.

00:11:46.080 --> 00:11:47.289
Who… who the hell are you?

00:11:49.166 --> 00:11:50.668
Oh no. Ninjas.

00:12:04.682 --> 00:12:06.559
Who are you? What are you doing here?

00:12:07.518 --> 00:12:09.687
You should know who I am.

00:12:09.770 --> 00:12:11.021
I'm Ninja Master--

00:12:20.489 --> 00:12:21.824
I said, who are you?

00:12:26.746 --> 00:12:29.707
Young lady,
you have got quite the strong kick.

00:12:32.293 --> 00:12:34.670
I think you and I
got off on the wrong foot.

00:12:34.754 --> 00:12:38.090
I'm Gara,
one of the rebel four heavenly kings,

00:12:38.174 --> 00:12:42.136
and there's something important
I need to ask you, young lady.

00:12:42.219 --> 00:12:46.140
You're the daughter of the Great Priest,
aren't you, Miss Yoko?

00:12:51.645 --> 00:12:55.858
Tell me, where's
the reincarnation of Dark Schneider?

00:12:55.941 --> 00:12:57.443
I don't know what you're talking about.

00:12:57.526 --> 00:12:59.737
Well, aren't you the stubborn girl.

00:13:01.363 --> 00:13:02.198
You do know

00:13:02.281 --> 00:13:05.868
that Venom is one of Dark Schneider's
original spells, correct?

00:13:06.452 --> 00:13:09.580
And I heard
the Hydra got killed by a golem.

00:13:09.663 --> 00:13:13.375
Golems can only be controlled
by the person who summons them.

00:13:13.876 --> 00:13:15.127
You understand?

00:13:16.754 --> 00:13:19.799
Dark Schneider
has been brought back to life.

00:13:20.299 --> 00:13:24.178
But what I don't understand is why
he's choosing to protect this kingdom.

00:13:24.261 --> 00:13:27.598
He stopped two invasions already.
It doesn't make sense.

00:13:27.681 --> 00:13:28.974
Why is he doing this?

00:13:29.058 --> 00:13:32.937
<i>This man wants</i>
<i>to get Dark Schneider back on his side.</i>

00:13:33.604 --> 00:13:36.190
Just tell me where he is.
Don't be stubborn.

00:13:36.982 --> 00:13:40.152
If you don't tell me, I'll make you pay.

00:13:40.236 --> 00:13:41.320
Damn you.

00:13:45.366 --> 00:13:47.576
What the hell do you think you're doing?

00:13:47.660 --> 00:13:50.788
Don't even think about touching me,
you disgusting lech!

00:13:51.372 --> 00:13:53.749
Hey. What's going on?

00:13:53.833 --> 00:13:54.875
<i>Oh no.</i>

00:13:54.959 --> 00:13:58.337
<i>If he realizes Dark Schneider</i>
<i>is sealed away inside Lucien…</i>

00:13:58.420 --> 00:14:00.965
Uh, nothing's going on.

00:14:01.048 --> 00:14:02.675
Just go back to sleep, okay?

00:14:02.758 --> 00:14:04.134
Okay.

00:14:06.136 --> 00:14:08.138
All right.

00:14:08.222 --> 00:14:10.724
Now you will tell me the truth, won't you?

00:14:10.808 --> 00:14:12.852
-Stop being so stubborn…
-Hey. Stop that!

00:14:12.935 --> 00:14:14.311
…or else I'll have fun.

00:14:14.395 --> 00:14:17.064
Come on.

00:14:18.440 --> 00:14:20.359
Stop, now!

00:14:21.193 --> 00:14:22.361
What?

00:14:22.444 --> 00:14:24.697
Gara, stop!

00:14:24.780 --> 00:14:26.657
Oh, I know that voice.

00:14:27.825 --> 00:14:29.910
Yoko is my woman.

00:14:30.411 --> 00:14:32.705
If you touch her again, I'll kill you!

00:14:32.788 --> 00:14:35.124
D-Dark Schneider!

00:14:35.207 --> 00:14:36.166
Is it you?

00:14:36.250 --> 00:14:38.043
No way.

00:14:38.127 --> 00:14:40.045
How did-- How could you have…

00:14:41.463 --> 00:14:43.674
You've broken the seal two times.

00:14:43.757 --> 00:14:46.719
And the more you break it,
the weaker it becomes.

00:14:46.802 --> 00:14:48.929
While Lucien sleeps, I'm in control.

00:14:49.013 --> 00:14:52.391
It won't be long
before I'm in control all the time.

00:14:52.474 --> 00:14:53.934
<i>No way.</i>

00:14:54.018 --> 00:14:56.478
<i>He was sealed inside a child.</i>

00:14:56.562 --> 00:14:59.231
Yoko! Yoko!

00:15:00.733 --> 00:15:02.484
Yoko, are you all right?

00:15:09.116 --> 00:15:11.994
What's that? A wyvern?

00:15:14.038 --> 00:15:16.707
Great Priest, Geo Noto Soto,

00:15:16.790 --> 00:15:18.542
I'm taking your daughter!

00:15:18.626 --> 00:15:21.837
If you want to see her again,
bring me Dark Schneider!

00:15:21.921 --> 00:15:24.590
What the… Is this seriously happening?

00:15:24.673 --> 00:15:26.133
-Yoko!
-Miss Yoko!

00:15:29.178 --> 00:15:32.056
Yoko!

00:15:36.018 --> 00:15:37.519
Let go!

00:15:37.603 --> 00:15:39.855
Stop squirming, would you?
You're going to fall.

00:15:41.065 --> 00:15:42.816
Where exactly are you taking me?

00:15:43.484 --> 00:15:45.486
Calm down, girl.

00:15:45.569 --> 00:15:47.529
We're almost to our destination.

00:15:47.613 --> 00:15:50.574
Look there! Can you see it?

00:15:51.575 --> 00:15:54.453
It's my ninja fortress.

00:15:56.538 --> 00:15:57.623
What's that?

00:15:57.706 --> 00:15:59.833
Miss Yoko was kidnapped by a ninja?

00:15:59.917 --> 00:16:03.045
Did he find out the truth
about Dark Schneider?

00:16:03.128 --> 00:16:05.798
He was trying
to get him to join his side.

00:16:05.881 --> 00:16:07.007
It's fine.

00:16:07.091 --> 00:16:10.260
Thankfully,
Lucien Renlen was able to escape.

00:16:10.344 --> 00:16:12.888
We've avoided the worst-case scenario.

00:16:12.972 --> 00:16:14.765
Can I go back to bed now, please?

00:16:16.684 --> 00:16:18.894
This is extremely concerning.

00:16:18.978 --> 00:16:22.481
I am sorry
about your daughter, Geo Noto Soto.

00:16:22.564 --> 00:16:25.150
Do you have any idea where they went?

00:16:25.234 --> 00:16:27.444
Let's get a squad together to rescue her.

00:16:27.528 --> 00:16:30.155
We can't. She was taken by ninjas.

00:16:30.239 --> 00:16:32.783
The only person
who knows where their base is…

00:16:34.159 --> 00:16:36.120
Hey. Where did Yoko go?

00:16:36.203 --> 00:16:37.621
Is she coming back soon?

00:16:37.705 --> 00:16:42.418
Except, the only person capable
of breaking his seal is Madam Tia.

00:16:42.501 --> 00:16:46.422
Hmm. To find a virgin maiden
who also knows magic,

00:16:46.505 --> 00:16:47.798
that may not be possible.

00:16:47.881 --> 00:16:50.009
There's always me.

00:16:50.592 --> 00:16:51.468
Sheila!

00:16:51.552 --> 00:16:53.554
The Great Priest is teaching me.

00:16:53.637 --> 00:16:56.598
I've been learning white magic
from him for a while now.

00:16:57.641 --> 00:16:59.226
Yes! That's a perfect idea!

00:16:59.309 --> 00:17:01.729
Are you sure, Princess Sheila?

00:17:01.812 --> 00:17:02.646
You…

00:17:03.564 --> 00:17:05.441
you need a virgin maiden's kiss.

00:17:05.524 --> 00:17:06.942
That's true, isn't it?

00:17:07.026 --> 00:17:08.068
Hmm?

00:17:09.611 --> 00:17:13.115
I'll do my best to perform the spell.

00:17:13.198 --> 00:17:14.158
No, no, no!

00:17:14.241 --> 00:17:16.160
I will not allow it! I won't!

00:17:16.243 --> 00:17:19.204
In the royal family,
a kiss is a sign of marriage!

00:17:19.705 --> 00:17:20.956
-We can't just--
-It's important!

00:17:21.040 --> 00:17:24.793
Yoko has worked hard for this kingdom,
and now she's the one in danger!

00:17:24.877 --> 00:17:27.171
I simply can't just stand by
and do nothing

00:17:27.254 --> 00:17:28.964
when I have the power to help her!

00:17:29.548 --> 00:17:33.510
No wonder the princess is so beloved
by all of our people.

00:17:33.594 --> 00:17:36.555
She speaks with such courage
and caring for her subjects.

00:17:38.640 --> 00:17:40.350
Sheila, no!

00:17:40.434 --> 00:17:43.020
You are a noble maiden
from a royal family.

00:17:43.103 --> 00:17:46.065
You cannot give away your kiss
to this evil man!

00:17:46.148 --> 00:17:48.484
We must stop him from getting worked up.

00:17:49.026 --> 00:17:52.279
One of you,
take the old king to is bedroom.

00:17:52.362 --> 00:17:53.322
Sir.

00:17:53.822 --> 00:17:56.617
Let go of me! I am the king!

00:17:56.700 --> 00:17:59.912
I say let go of me! I will cut you!

00:18:02.456 --> 00:18:04.875
Do the steps as I taught you just now.

00:18:04.958 --> 00:18:07.127
The key is to focus on the spell.

00:18:07.211 --> 00:18:08.337
Of course. Yes.

00:18:09.755 --> 00:18:11.173
Come here, Lucien Renlen.

00:18:11.256 --> 00:18:12.591
Okay.

00:18:12.674 --> 00:18:15.511
This could potentially be very dangerous.

00:18:15.594 --> 00:18:18.972
What if he joins up with Kall-Su
as soon as he awakens?

00:18:19.056 --> 00:18:21.058
What are you talking about? It'll be fine.

00:18:21.809 --> 00:18:26.188
By kidnapping Yoko,
Gara made an enemy of Dark Schneider.

00:18:26.271 --> 00:18:27.564
Yeah. 'Kay.

00:18:27.648 --> 00:18:31.360
Besides,
he chose to save the other day, didn't he?

00:18:32.653 --> 00:18:36.907
Yes. Bringing him back is risky,
but he's not the same man he was before.

00:18:36.990 --> 00:18:39.910
Dark Schneider
has actually changed quite a bit.

00:18:39.993 --> 00:18:44.623
He's been sealed for the past 14 years,
living inside the boy, Lucien.

00:18:44.706 --> 00:18:47.251
Sharing Lucien's feelings and memories.

00:18:47.334 --> 00:18:52.381
Therefore, Dark Schneider's persona
is intertwined with Lucien's.

00:18:53.006 --> 00:18:56.552
<i>In the royal family,</i>
<i>a kiss is a sign of marriage.</i>

00:18:59.012 --> 00:19:00.013
Accept this.

00:19:02.683 --> 00:19:06.645
It's risky,
but the fate of the world is at stake.

00:19:06.728 --> 00:19:08.647
Dark Schneider is the only one

00:19:08.730 --> 00:19:12.234
who can stop Kall-Su
from resurrecting the demon god!

00:19:13.026 --> 00:19:17.906
In the name of our dear goddess,
Ino Mata, the Beautiful…

00:19:18.574 --> 00:19:20.742
Dark Schneider is our only hope.

00:19:20.826 --> 00:19:24.079
There is a great deal
of hidden potential inside of him.

00:19:24.163 --> 00:19:25.914
<i>He will be our savior.</i>

00:19:29.960 --> 00:19:31.420
Now, release.

00:19:44.641 --> 00:19:46.018
Dark Schneider.

00:19:51.440 --> 00:19:53.442
What's going on?

00:19:53.525 --> 00:19:55.152
He seems different from before.

00:19:55.235 --> 00:19:56.278
Uh…

00:19:56.361 --> 00:19:57.613
Ugh.

00:19:57.696 --> 00:20:02.284
I can't believe I let some woman I don't
even know give me a kiss like that.

00:20:02.367 --> 00:20:05.245
I am so very confused. Huh?

00:20:05.329 --> 00:20:06.747
Geo…

00:20:06.830 --> 00:20:11.668
One of your old allies,
Ninja Master Gara, has kidnapped Tia.

00:20:11.752 --> 00:20:13.629
I know what he did.

00:20:13.712 --> 00:20:15.464
Please, as her father,

00:20:16.089 --> 00:20:17.132
I beg you.

00:20:17.216 --> 00:20:19.801
Save my daughter and bring her home.

00:20:19.885 --> 00:20:22.012
Please! We need your assistance!

00:20:22.095 --> 00:20:25.515
And besides, you've already shown
that Yoko is someone important to you.

00:20:25.599 --> 00:20:28.435
And while you're at it,
can you defeat the Four Divine Kings

00:20:28.518 --> 00:20:30.729
and stop them
from resurrecting the demon god?

00:20:30.812 --> 00:20:33.941
We'll see.
I'm not really feeling it right now.

00:20:34.024 --> 00:20:35.234
-That can't be!
-What?

00:20:36.902 --> 00:20:40.364
Maybe it's a good thing
that bossy Yoko's finally gone.

00:20:40.447 --> 00:20:43.242
Now I'm free to do whatever I wanna do.

00:20:45.244 --> 00:20:46.912
How ungrateful of you!

00:20:46.995 --> 00:20:48.580
You can't just abandon her!

00:20:48.664 --> 00:20:51.667
But before,
you told us that you love Tia Noto Yoko.

00:20:51.750 --> 00:20:53.043
Has that changed?

00:20:53.126 --> 00:20:54.670
I don't know what you mean.

00:20:54.753 --> 00:20:56.755
Why are you acting so strange?

00:20:56.838 --> 00:20:59.883
You can't really still be mad at her
for scolding you, can you?

00:20:59.967 --> 00:21:01.927
Shut up, old man!

00:21:02.010 --> 00:21:03.262
Once I conquer the world,

00:21:03.345 --> 00:21:06.139
I can have my way
with any woman my heart desires.

00:21:07.683 --> 00:21:11.395
Yoko or Sheila.
It doesn't really matter to me.

00:21:14.356 --> 00:21:16.692
You fool! Get away from her!

00:21:16.775 --> 00:21:18.610
You horrible pervert!

00:21:18.694 --> 00:21:20.654
You are rude and offensive!

00:21:23.865 --> 00:21:27.286
I see you haven't changed.
You're still an evil man.

00:21:27.369 --> 00:21:29.162
So what will happen to Yoko, then?

00:21:29.746 --> 00:21:31.039
You think I care?

00:21:31.123 --> 00:21:33.917
Oh, and I like me just the way I am.

00:21:43.969 --> 00:21:46.221
I am so disappointed!

00:21:49.850 --> 00:21:52.978
You are a foolish little princess.

00:23:37.374 --> 00:23:39.209
Come on, now.

00:23:39.292 --> 00:23:42.921
Be nice and tell me
how to break Dark Schneider's seal.

00:23:43.004 --> 00:23:45.465
Or else I get to have my fun.

00:23:45.549 --> 00:23:46.675
No way!

00:23:46.758 --> 00:23:49.386
Get the hell away from me, creep!
